      "meaning": "Vibhīṣaṇa returns and bows. The ocean of compassion summons Lakṣmaṇa, Sugrīva, Aṅgada, Nala, Nīla, Jāmbavān and Hanumān and sends them together to crown Vibhīṣaṇa. Because his father’s command prevents him from entering the city, Rāma sends his brother and monkey friends as his own representatives. They promptly prepare the coronation, respectfully seat Vibhīṣaṇa on the throne, complete the anointing and offer praise. All bow and return with the new king; Raghubīra calls the monkeys near and delights them with affectionate words.",
